ing your camera?","id":"e7cf3288eb78","source":"BTS 14 · #91"},"dc5cad233cb0":{"text":"Yes, I will take lots of pictures.","id":"dc5cad233cb0","source":"BTS 14 · #92"},"f6a2f0279322":{"text":"I will see dinosaur fossils and ancient artifacts.","id":"f6a2f0279322","source":"BTS 14 · #94","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/54960757-845a-4068-83d8-464855a92bcf.webp","imageBytes":34912},"9dbaf6dfb889":{"text":"Yes, I expect to learn many new things.","id":"9dbaf6dfb889","source":"BTS 14 · #96","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/5a169efe-42a3-4d2b-995e-3ed7258bef3b.webp","imageBytes":7560},"b4a22583f2a3":{"text":"Will you learn something new?","id":"b4a22583f2a3","source":"BTS 14 · #95"},"3365e673e580":{"text":"Maybe, but it will be worth it.","id":"3365e673e580","source":"BTS 14 · #98","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/800d92a0-3ed3-4b72-b11e-634411533ab1.webp","imageBytes":10122},"2841f04a0d80":{"text":"Will you tell your family about it?","id":"2841f04a0d80","source":"BTS 14 · #99"},"249c6f96877f":{"text":"Of course, I will tell them all about it.","id":"249c6f96877f","source":"BTS 14 · #100"}}}
